| Mode | Initial test NLL | Final test NLL | Greedy exact |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Translation | 6.156409 | 2.126995 | 0/64 |
| T5-style | 6.259364 | 1.079726 | 15/96 |

T5-style exact matches out of 32 per task. Denoising 0, reversal 0, classification 15.

Translation upstream replay maximum error 1.669e-06, with identical greedy output.

T5-style upstream replay maximum error 2.384e-06, with identical greedy output.
